<title>THAILAND: TABLE-BANGCHAK first six mth net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BANGCHAK first six mth net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Second quarter</p>
<p>				 1997			1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     0.22	 vs	   0.55</p>
<p>    Net		    113.93	 vs	 289.41</p>
<p>				   Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     0.04	 vs	   1.28</p>
<p>    Net		     22.70	 vs	 666.64</p>
<p>Notes: Results are audited. The company's full name is The Bangchak Petroleum Plc, a pertoleum refiner and distributor.</p>
